### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = test-slug@example.com
@username = testslug
@password = Test1234!

### 1. Inscription
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Connexion
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Token
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. Créer un challenge (génère le slug automatiquement)
# @name createChallenge
POST {{baseUrl}}/challenges
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Elden Ring Speedrun Any Percent",
  "scoreFormat": "time",
  "description": "Complete the game as fast as possible",
  "gameId": 326243,
  "gameTitle": "Elden Ring",
  "gameSlug": "elden-ring",
  "gameImageUrl": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/5ec/5ecac5cb026ec26a56efcc546364e348.jpg"
}

### 5. Extraire le slug du challenge créé
@challengeSlug = {{createChallenge.response.body.challenge.slug}}

### 6. Récupérer le challenge PAR SLUG (nouvelle route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/challenges/{{challengeSlug}}

### 7. Tester avec un slug qui n'existe pas (doit retourner 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/challenges/challenge-inexistant

### 8. Récupérer le jeu PAR SLUG
GET {{baseUrl}}/games/elden-ring